# The sources are LF everywhere so a checkout on any platform matches what the
# tests read and what `npm pack` publishes. Generated launchers are written at
# runtime and are never committed, but a batch file added by hand later must
# keep CRLF: cmd.exe reads a lone LF as part of the line.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
